4, the number of annual WPV case reports in Afghanistan and Pakistan rose in 2018\"}]}], \"methods_quotes\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"The first indicator is achieving an annual nonpolio AFP detection rate of ≥1 case per 100,000 population aged <15 years\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"five genetic clusters (groups of isolates sharing ≥95% of genetic relatedness)\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"The performance of AFP surveillance is assessed through two principal indicators.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}